        {
          "text": "ndipo BWANA, Mungu wako, atakapougeuza utumwa wako, naye atakuhurumia, tena atarejea na kukukusanya kutoka mataifa yote, huko alikokutawanyia BWANA, Mungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
